These .edsl files are examples from excalidraw-dsl
(https://github.com/tyrchen/excalidraw-dsl, examples/), copied unchanged
under its MIT license; see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.  excali-mode read this
language through 0.1.x; since 0.2.0 it has been replaced by Excali DSL
(.excalidsl), and the tests no longer draw these files.
